{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey. Im SUPERita <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/mini_super.png?t=1750443459\" /></div>\u00a0and I love card games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So i made a game where everything is cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and you can combine cards to create new cards (<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/min_4.png?t=1750443459\" /></div>\u00a0+\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/min_5.png?t=1750443459\" /></div>\u00a0=\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/min_6.png?t=1750443459\" /></div>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/pizzaStick.gif?t=1750443459\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">even your save file is a card\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/min_3.png?t=1750443459\" /></div>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find cards:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you start with a deck and monsters and keys are shuffled into it at the start of every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and after you find all keys, you go to the shop where you can buy better cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the more card recipes you know the better chances you have to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and the better combos you can make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/reroll.gif?t